    "summary": "DocSummarySweepDeps.takeEdit now returns a Promise and runDocSummarySweep awaits it. That await comes before the document read, and the final shouldStop/isCodeIdle checks still run after the last await, immediately before summarise. IndexerService wraps the queue's synchronous takeDocSummaryEdit in an async function. The sweep test's stub is now async. summary-sweep-progress.test.ts overrides the queue's own synchronous method, which did not change, so it needed no edit. A new test uses a takeEdit that answers a macrotask later, with code work arriving during the lookup just before a document read. It checks that no summary starts while code is queued and that an edit queued mid-sweep runs before the next document. Removing the final isCodeIdle check makes it fail.",
